% Jutzi cratering smoke test (Phase 17e, CGS units)
% Basalt impactor into basalt target, 3 km/s impact.
% CompositionType=2 (basalt) for all particles; per-material Tillotson params
% are loaded from the built-in table via tillotson_eos_init() into slots [2][*].
% Slot [0][*] (below) is the fallback / required universal set; we populate it
% with basalt values since GIZMO requires these tags.  All values in code units
% (UnitLength=UnitMass=UnitVelocity=1 => code units = CGS here).

% Tillotson EOS params for slot [0] (universal fallback, basalt values in CGS=code)
Tillotson_EOS_params_a          0.5
Tillotson_EOS_params_b          1.5
Tillotson_EOS_params_u_0        4.87e12
Tillotson_EOS_params_rho_0      2.7
Tillotson_EOS_params_A          2.67e11
Tillotson_EOS_params_B          2.67e11
Tillotson_EOS_params_u_s        4.72e10
Tillotson_EOS_params_u_s_prime  1.82e11
Tillotson_EOS_params_alpha      5.0
Tillotson_EOS_params_beta       5.0
Tillotson_EOS_params_mu         2.27e11
Tillotson_EOS_params_Y0         3.5e10

InitCondFile                       jutzi_crater_ics
OutputDir                          output
SnapshotFileBase                   snapshot

TimeMax                            1.0e-5
TimeBetSnapshot                    5.0e-6
TimeBegin                          0.0
OutputListOn                       0

MaxSizeTimestep                    5.0e-7
MinSizeTimestep                    1.0e-12
CourantFac                         0.2
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1

DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1

ErrTolForceAcc                     0.001
ErrTolTheta                        0.7

TimeBetStatistics                  5.0e-6
MaxMemSize                         1000

ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none

UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s           1.0
UnitLength_in_cm                   1.0
UnitMass_in_g                      1.0
